sequenceDiagram
    Student ->> EnrollmentService: Initiate Enrollment
    EnrollmentService ->> AcademicManagementService: Check Prerequisites
    AcademicManagementService --> EnrollmentService: Return Prerequisite Status
    EnrollmentService ->> SchedulingService: Check Capacity
    SchedulingService --> EnrollmentService: Return Availability
    EnrollmentService ->> AcademicManagementService: Create Enrollment Record
    AcademicManagementService --> EnrollmentService: Confirm Enrollment
    EnrollmentService ->> SchedulingService: Update Schedule
    SchedulingService --> EnrollmentService: Confirm Update
    EnrollmentService ->> CommunicationService: Send Notification
    CommunicationService --> EnrollmentService: Confirm Notification Sent